#: src/plattenalbum.py:1057
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "Configuración"

#: src/plattenalbum.py:1058
msgid ""
"To get started, install the Music Player Daemon (<tt>mpd</tt>) with your "
"system package manager, and run the following commands to configure and "
"initialize a basic local instance. After that, Plattenalbum should be able "
"to seamlessly connect to it."
msgstr ""
"Para empezar, instala Music Player Daemon (<tt>mpd</tt>) con el gestor de "
"paquetes de tu sistema y ejecuta los siguientes comandos para configurar e "
"inicializar una instancia local básica. Después, Plattenalbum debería poder "
"conectarse a ella sin problemas."

